  "review": {
    "description": "Matrix-free reflected-geometry proof reuse and independent validation.",
    "assessment": "No proof, public API, data or dependency-cycle defect found. Five existing ArithmeticCellPhysical theorems discharge the original statements. All target, client, old axiom and actual Foundation matrix co-import checks passed and their logs match. Eight client prerequisite statuses and source/log/object hashes and the 40 source/import graph pins were checked. Corrected padding and preliminary count objects match earlier successful source/object receipts. The target and direct client logs have no warnings; the direct client object hashes match.",
    "failures": "The first prototype failed because ArithmeticCellTable was missing; its source was later overwritten by the successful candidate. Both initial client attempts failed because incomplete overlay setup omitted MFCurrentClause2011; corrected authenticated overlays passed.",
    "warning_scope": "The once-refreshed unchanged MFPaper1982Section4 prerequisite emits one unused-simp warning. No paired fresh baseline of that prerequisite was recorded.",
    "foundation": "Both successful runs actually imported Foundation.Vorspiel.Matrix, with the same recorded object hash."
  },
  "limitations": [
    "Earlier project, Foundation and Mathlib dependencies remain precompiled; this is not a fresh full dependency closure.",
    "The once-refreshed prerequisite warning has no comparable fresh baseline.",
    "The first prototype source was overwritten; its failure log and time record are retained.",
    "Timing observations are single concurrent builds, not a controlled performance comparison.",
    "Compiled objects and overlay symlinks are excluded; hashes and prior receipts are retained."
